10: `#[gimmeback]` method must take `(&self, &[Atom])`
16: `#[gimmeback]` method must take `(&self, &[Atom])`
21: `dblclick` is an untyped message Max calls with its own arguments, which a typed selector would misread; use `#[dblclick]` instead
27: `assist` is a selector median registers for itself (inlets, assist, dsp); pick another name
33: `#[gimmeback]` takes only a selector name; it receives all the atoms
